<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: TENNIS-IVORY COAST LEAD LATVIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-IVORY COAST LEAD LATVIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast took a 2-0 lead over</p>
<p>Latvia in their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African zone group two</p>
<p>first round tie on Friday:</p>
<p>Results (Ivorian names first):</p>
<p>Claude N'Goran beat Ivo Lagzdins 6-1 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Clement N'Goran beat Raimonds Sproga 6-4 6-2 6-0</p>
</text>
